gaJI(){return'Biggest Winners \u2014 P/L% \xd7 position weight\n\nCombines how well a stock performed with how much of your shown portfolio it represents.\nA +40% gain on 20% of your portfolio outranks a +40% gain on 2%.\n\nWeight is each holding\'s value in your display currency, relative to the stocks currently shown (tag filter affects this). A holding with no exchange rate is left out and shows "no rate".'},
