aKl(a){return"Splits your total profit/loss into money you have LOCKED IN and money still FLOATING.\n\n\u2022 Locked In (Realized) \u2014 P/L on shares you have already sold (plus dividends attributed to them). This is booked; market moves no longer change it.\n\u2022 Floating (Unrealized) \u2014 P/L on shares you still hold. It moves with the market until you sell.\n\nBoth are in "+a+": each holding's result is measured in its own currency and converted at today's rate.\n\nThis Total P/L is not the Portfolio Summary's. It also counts fully sold holdings and the dividends on sold shares, and it leaves out how exchange rates have moved since you bought \u2014 so the two can differ.\n\nDividends on shares you still hold are not counted here (Real vs Paper counts them)."},
gaKi(){return'This card uses the "Return on cost" lens.\n\nReturn on cost = your profit \xf7 the cost of everything it was earned on: the shares you still hold plus the shares you have sold. It answers: "how much has my money made on what I put at risk?"\n\nThe "Cost" row is that cost. P/L, Cost and Value are converted at today\'s exchange rates.\n\nThe "Do I Beat the Market?" card shows no return percentage. Its "You made" is your profit in money: what you hold today, plus the cash you got back from sells and dividends, minus everything you put in \u2014 with each trade at its own date\'s exchange rate where one exists, so it can differ from the P/L here.\n\nFor a yearly rate that accounts for when you invested, see the Personal IRR card.'},
gaKj(){return"Return on cost \u2014 profit \xf7 the cost of everything it was earned on. Includes sold positions and the dividends on shares you have sold (not those on shares you still hold), so it can differ from the Portfolio tab (which shows open holdings only)."},
gaKk(){return"Return on cost \u2014 profit \xf7 the cost of everything it was earned on. Start a Paper Portfolio to compare a risk-free test run against your real money side by side."},
gaKm(){return"Noted rounds did worse."},
aKn(a,b){return"Rounds with a written reason ended at a median "+a+", un-noted ones at "+b+"."},
gaKo(){return"Noted rounds did better."},
a9u(a){return"Becomes measurable at "+a+" noted rounds."},
gaKp(){return"No round carries a written reason yet."},
aKq(a,b){return a+" of your rounds carry a written reason, "+b+" of your sales."},
aKr(a,b,c){var s=null,r=A.av(a,s,this.a,s,"round","rounds",s,s)
return"The last "+A.w(c)+" months hold "+a+" "+r+" \u2014 under the floor of "+b+", so every trait reads \u2014 there."},
