ga1g(){return"Set financial targets and track your progress over time.\n\n\u2022 Target amount \u2014 the portfolio value you want to reach\n\u2022 Return per year \u2014 a yearly return you aim for, measured by Personal IRR from Analysis\n\u2022 Deadline \u2014 optional date to hit the goal by\n\u2022 Progress chart \u2014 shows your actual portfolio value vs the target line over time\n\u2022 Asset classes \u2014 optionally scope a goal to specific asset types (Stocks, ETFs, Crypto\u2026)\n\nPortfolio snapshots are recorded automatically each time prices refresh, so your progress curve fills in day by day."},
