gbgA(){return"Data is processed for the following purposes, each based on performance of the contract between the user and the developer (GDPR Art. 6(1)(b)):\n\n\u2022 Email address \u2014 to create and maintain the user account.\n\u2022 Portfolio data, journal entries, goals, and Weekly Ten filters and lists \u2014 to provide the core storage and display function of the Service.\n\u2022 Authentication tokens \u2014 to authenticate the user session.\n\u2022 Billing and subscription status \u2014 to verify access to premium features. This data is processed by the applicable app store platform; the developer receives only confirmation of subscription status.\n\nProvision of an email address is a contractual requirement for use of the Service. Users who do not provide it cannot use the Service."},
gbgB(){return"Purposes and Legal Bases"},
gbgC(){return"Data is retained for as long as the user maintains an account. Upon account deletion request submitted via the Privacy Contact form in app Settings, account data will be removed from active systems. Removal from backup systems may take additional time. The developer retains the right to retain data to the extent required by applicable law or for the establishment, exercise, or defence of legal claims."},
gbgD(){return"Data Retention"},
gbgE(){return"If you are located in the European Economic Area, you have the following rights under GDPR with respect to your personal data:\n\n\u2022 Right of access (Art. 15)\n\u2022 Right to rectification (Art. 16)\n\u2022 Right to erasure (Art. 17)\n\u2022 Right to restriction of processing (Art. 18)\n\u2022 Right to data portability (Art. 20)\n\nTo exercise any of these rights, use the Privacy Contact form in app Settings (Settings \u2192 Privacy Contact). You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the Swedish Authority for Privacy Protection (Integritetsskyddsmyndigheten, imy.se)."},
