gbgH(){return"Data Storage"},
gbgI(){return"The Service uses the following third-party services:\n\n\u2022 Supabase \u2014 data storage and authentication infrastructure. See supabase.com/privacy.\n\u2022 Apple App Store / Google Play \u2014 subscription billing and payment processing for premium features. The developer does not receive full payment card details. See apple.com/legal/privacy and policies.google.com/privacy.\n\u2022 Sentry \u2014 crash and error reporting. When the application encounters an unhandled error, diagnostic information is transmitted to Sentry, Inc. This includes the error message, stack trace, device type, operating system version, and app version. No portfolio data, financial figures, journal entries, or user-identifiable information is transmitted. IP addresses are not collected. See sentry.io/privacy.\n\nThe Service retrieves publicly available market data from third-party sources. No personal data is transmitted to those sources. The developer is not responsible for the data practices of any third-party service."},
